---
import PitchSlide from '../PitchSlide.astro';
const TOTAL = 13;
---
<PitchSlide id="slide-problem" slideNumber={3} totalSlides={TOTAL}>
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-surface-500 uppercase mb-3">The Problem</p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">European businesses are locked into<br/>expensive American platforms.</h2>
    <p class="text-surface-300 text-sm mb-5 max-w-3xl">Every company building a web or mobile app needs the same infrastructure: admin panels, user management, APIs, and file storage. Today, they either spend months rebuilding it from scratch — or lock into US-controlled platforms like Firebase, Supabase, or Retool.</p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-surface-700 bg-surface-900/50 p-5">
            <div class="text-3xl font-semibold text-rose-400 mb-1">72%</div>
            <p class="text-surface-300 text-xs">of EU enterprises outsource their ICT functions — most lack the in-house capacity to build custom software.</p>
            <p class="text-3xs mt-2 text-surface-400">Source: <a href="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php?title=ICT_specialists_-_statistics_on_hard-to-fill_vacancies_in_enterprises" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline hover:text-white">Eurostat ICT Specialists Survey, 2024</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-surface-700 bg-surface-900/50 p-5">
            <div class="text-3xl font-semibold text-amber-400 mb-1">14 tools</div>
            <p class="text-surface-300 text-xs">average number of DevOps tools a developer must manage — 59% say it takes over a week just to build internal tooling.</p>
            <p class="text-3xs mt-2 text-surface-400">Source: <a href="https://www.harness.io/state-of-developer-experience" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline hover:text-white">Harness State of Developer Experience, 2025</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-surface-700 bg-surface-900/50 p-5">
            <div class="text-3xl font-semibold text-violet-400 mb-1">US-seated</div>
            <p class="text-surface-300 text-xs">the platforms in this category are operated by companies a US court can reach. European alternatives exist — Strapi is French — but none puts authorization in the database and hands you the whole product under MIT.</p>
            <p class="text-3xs mt-2 text-surface-400">Source: competitive analysis, see the Competition slide</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-surface-700 bg-surface-900/30 p-3">
        <p class="text-xs text-surface-300"><strong class="text-white">The result:</strong> European startups and SMEs lose competitive advantage, bleed development budgets on commodity infrastructure, and depend on platforms that can change pricing, terms, or access at any time.</p>
    </div>
</PitchSlide>
